    @Test void verifiedExecutionsVaryReuseWithoutQuotaAndRejectForgedOrStaleResults(){var run=toExecution();var saved=save(run,"adjust","{\"multiplier\":1,\"include\":\"ALL\"}");var request=new RunDtos.Execute("demo-summary-v1",saved.revision(),json("{}"),null,null);String idemKey=key();var result=executions.execute(student,run.runId(),idemKey,request);assertEquals(26,result.result().get("sum").intValue());assertEquals("SERVER_VERIFIED",result.trustLevel());assertEquals(result.executionId(),executions.execute(student,run.runId(),idemKey,request).executionId());
        saved=save(run,"adjust","{\"multiplier\":1,\"include\":\"ALL\"}");var reused=executions.execute(student,run.runId(),key(),new RunDtos.Execute("demo-summary-v1",saved.revision(),json("{}"),null,null));assertTrue(reused.reused());assertEquals(5,reused.remainingEvaluations());assertEquals(result.executionId(),reused.executionId());
        saved=save(run,"adjust","{\"multiplier\":3,\"include\":\"FIRST_TWO\"}");var current=saved;error("EXECUTION_REVISION_STALE",()->executions.execute(student,run.runId(),key(),request));error("EXECUTION_RESULT_MISMATCH",()->executions.execute(student,run.runId(),key(),new RunDtos.Execute("demo-summary-v1",current.revision(),json("{}"),null,json("{\"count\":2,\"sum\":99,\"mean\":49.5,\"multiplier\":3,\"include\":\"FIRST_TWO\"}"))));var different=executions.execute(student,run.runId(),key(),new RunDtos.Execute("demo-summary-v1",saved.revision(),json("{}"),null,null));assertEquals(21,different.result().get("sum").intValue());assertEquals(4,different.remainingEvaluations());}
    @Test void pendingReflectionCanPauseAndCloseOnceWithImmutableInputAndNoProfessionalReport(){
        var run=toReflection();String runId=run.runId();var draft=reflections.get(student,runId);
        var incomplete=new RunDtos.ReflectionSave(draft.revision(),draft.questionSetVersion(),json("{}"));
        error("REFLECTION_INCOMPLETE",()->reflections.submit(student,runId,key(),incomplete));
        reflections.save(student,runId,incomplete);
        var paused=runs.transition(student,runId,"pause",key(),new RunDtos.Transition(current(run).revision(),null,null));
        assertEquals("TASK_COMPLETED",paused.pausedFromStatus());assertTrue(reflections.get(student,runId).readOnly());
        run=runs.transition(student,runId,"resume",key(),new RunDtos.Transition(paused.revision(),null,null));assertEquals("TASK_COMPLETED",run.status());
        draft=reflections.get(student,runId);String closeKey=key();
        var valid=new RunDtos.ReflectionSave(draft.revision(),draft.questionSetVersion(),json("{\"interestingStepKeys\":[\"adjust\"],\"difficultySources\":[\"NONE\"],\"continueSimilarWork\":\"UNSURE\"}"));
        var closed=reflections.submit(student,runId,closeKey,valid);assertEquals("CLOSED",closed.status());assertEquals("NOT_APPLICABLE",closed.reportStatus());
        assertEquals(closed,reflections.submit(student,runId,closeKey,valid));
        assertEquals(1,db.queryForObject("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mp_run_closure_request q JOIN mp_experience_run r ON r.id=q.experience_run_id WHERE r.student_id=? AND q.status='DEMO_COMPLETE'",Integer.class,student.internalId()));
        assertEquals(0,db.queryForObject("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mp_experience_run WHERE student_id=? AND active_guard=1",Integer.class,student.internalId()));
        error("RUN_STATE_INVALID",()->runs.recover(1,closed.runId(),key(),new RunDtos.Recovery(closed.revision(),"TECHNICAL_FAILURE","Synthetic recovery is forbidden for closed run"),"test"));
    }
